               PROVE
                 /\ L1!CreditMatchesArena
                 /\ L1!ArenaRespectsPhase
                 /\ L1!NoBufferOutlivesItsCall
                 /\ L1!RefinementCoupling
                 /\ L1!L0!TypeOK
                 /\ L1!L0!SlotsAreNotShared
                 /\ L1!L0!PhaseMatchesLiveness
                 /\ L1!L0!QueueBounded
    OBVIOUS
  <1>0. L1!L0!IndInv
    BY RefinesDown, Zenon
  <1>1.
        /\ L1!CreditMatchesArena
        /\ L1!ArenaRespectsPhase
        /\ L1!NoBufferOutlivesItsCall
    <2>1. L1!CreditMatchesArena
      <3>1. L1!IndInv => L1!CreditMatchesArena
        <4>1. L1!IndInv => L1!CreditMatchesArena
          BY Asm, L1!Q5Holds, Zenon
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1
    <2>2. L1!ArenaRespectsPhase
      <3>1. L1!IndInv => L1!ArenaRespectsPhase
        <4>1. L1!IndInv => L1!ArenaRespectsPhase
          BY Asm, L1!Q6Holds, Zenon
        <4>2. QED
