          BY Asm, L1!Q7Holds, Zenon
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1
    <2>4. QED
      BY <2>1, <2>2, <2>3
  <1>2.
        /\ L1!RefinementCoupling
        /\ L1!L0!TypeOK
    <2>1. L1!RefinementCoupling
      <3>1. L1!IndInv => L1!RefinementCoupling
        <4>1. L1!IndInv => L1!RefinementCoupling
          BY Asm, L1!Q8Holds, Zenon
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1
    <2>2. L1!L0!TypeOK
      <3>1. L1!L0!IndInv => L1!L0!TypeOK
        <4>1. L1!L0!TypeOK
          <5>1. L1!L0!IndInv
            BY RefinesDown, Zenon
          <5>2. QED
            BY <5>1, Asm, AsmDown, L1!L0!P1Holds, Zenon
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1, RefinesDown
    <2>3. QED
      BY <2>1, <2>2
  <1>3.
        /\ L1!L0!SlotsAreNotShared
        /\ L1!L0!PhaseMatchesLiveness
        /\ L1!L0!QueueBounded
    <2>1. L1!L0!SlotsAreNotShared
      <3>1. L1!L0!IndInv => L1!L0!SlotsAreNotShared
        <4>1. L1!L0!SlotsAreNotShared
          <5>1. L1!L0!IndInv
            BY RefinesDown, Zenon
          <5>2. QED
            BY <5>1, Asm, AsmDown, L1!L0!P2Holds, Zenon
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1, RefinesDown
    <2>2. L1!L0!PhaseMatchesLiveness
      <3>1. L1!L0!IndInv => L1!L0!PhaseMatchesLiveness
        <4>1. L1!L0!PhaseMatchesLiveness
          <5>1. L1!L0!IndInv
            BY RefinesDown, Zenon
          <5>2. QED
            BY <5>1, Asm, AsmDown, L1!L0!P3Holds, Zenon
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1, RefinesDown
    <2>3. L1!L0!QueueBounded
      <3>1. L1!L0!IndInv => L1!L0!QueueBounded
        <4>1. L1!L0!QueueBounded
