LEMMA Open38 ==
    L1!IndInv =>
        /\ L1!NoBufferOutlivesItsCall
        /\ L1!L0!ClosingDrains
  <1> SUFFICES ASSUME L1!IndInv
               PROVE
                 /\ L1!NoBufferOutlivesItsCall
                 /\ L1!L0!ClosingDrains
    OBVIOUS
  <1>1. L1!NoBufferOutlivesItsCall
    <2>1. L1!IndInv => L1!NoBufferOutlivesItsCall
      <3>1. L1!NoBufferOutlivesItsCall
        <4>1. L1!IndInv
          OBVIOUS
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1 DEF L1!IndInv
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1
    <2>2. QED
      BY <2>1
  <1>2. L1!L0!ClosingDrains
    <2>1. L1!L0!IndInv
      BY RefinesDown, Zenon
    <2>2. L1!L0!ClosingDrains
      <3>1. L1!L0!IndInv => L1!L0!ClosingDrains
        <4>1. ASSUME L1!L0!IndInv
                     PROVE  L1!L0!ClosingDrains
          <5>1. L1!L0!ClosingDrains
            BY <4>1 DEF L1!L0!IndInv
          <5>2. QED
            BY <5>1
        <4>2. QED
          BY <4>1
      <3>2. QED
        BY <3>1, <2>1
    <2>3. QED
      BY <2>2
  <1>3. QED
    BY <1>1, <1>2

LEMMA Cite39 ==
